# Raw per-suite-run artifacts (workspaces, adapter logs, journals) stay local;
# committed summaries are copied out deliberately (benchmarks/README.md).
*
!.gitignore
!discrimination.json
# git never descends into an ignored DIRECTORY, so a bare `!**/probe.json` is inert
# (F-293). The per-task dirs must be re-included first — but ONLY at depth 1: a
# recursive `!*/` would also expose the nested suite `workspace/` git repos and
# stage them as orphan gitlinks (the defect that killed run-838ae110).
!/*/
!/*/probe.json
